OL,5,
OL,6,FFlights are delayed at major US
OL,7,Fairports after construction workers cut
OL,8,Fa cable needed for air traffic control,
OL,9,Fa top aviation official says
OL,11,FSecretary of Transportation Sean Duffy
OL,12,Fsays the crew was working for rail
OL,13,Foperator Amtrak when the cable was cut
OL,14,Fin New Jersey, impacting airports in
OL,15,FNew York and Philadelphia among others
OL,17,FGround stops have been ordered at
OL,18,Fairports in New Jersey, while Duffy
OL,19,Fsays flights are resuming at New York's
OL,20,FLaGuardia and Philadelphia - though the
OL,21,Fairports are still experiencing heavy
OL,22,Fdelays
